        "id": "cgei-geo-36-2-3",
        "kind": "prose",
        "title": "Sensitive boundaries and attribution",
        "body": "Disputed boundaries require applicable national mapping rules and clear disclaimers. Web maps need tile attribution and licence statements. Reproducible map styling belongs in version-controlled scripts—not only in a one-off GUI session."
